      <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; color: #0369a1; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
        3. Content (Rich Text — Copy &amp; Paste Directly into Blog Editor)
      </h2>
      <div class="blog-rich-content" style="border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 18px; background-color: #ffffff; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6; color: #0f172a;">
        <h2><strong>Data&nbsp;Science&nbsp;Career&nbsp;in&nbsp;India&nbsp;2026:&nbsp;Scope,&nbsp;Salary&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Future&nbsp;</strong></h2><p>Every&nbsp;year,&nbsp;students&nbsp;after&nbsp;completing&nbsp;their&nbsp;12th&nbsp;boards&nbsp;wonder&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;same&nbsp;question&nbsp;“which&nbsp;field&nbsp;has&nbsp;the&nbsp;best&nbsp;future”&nbsp;and&nbsp;you&nbsp;know&nbsp;what?&nbsp;The&nbsp;name&nbsp;of&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;has&nbsp;been&nbsp;a&nbsp;part&nbsp;of&nbsp;this&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;last&nbsp;5&nbsp;years.&nbsp;</p><p>And&nbsp;the&nbsp;reason&nbsp;is&nbsp;quite&nbsp;simple&nbsp;–&nbsp;huge&nbsp;demand&nbsp;for&nbsp;professionals&nbsp;who&nbsp;have&nbsp;the&nbsp;best&nbsp;knowledge&nbsp;of&nbsp;data&nbsp;science.</p><h2><strong>Turning&nbsp;Data&nbsp;into&nbsp;Decisions:&nbsp;What&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science&nbsp;Really&nbsp;Means</strong></h2><p>Ok,&nbsp;let&nbsp;me&nbsp;explain&nbsp;you&nbsp;this&nbsp;from&nbsp;very&nbsp;basic,&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;real&nbsp;life&nbsp;example.&nbsp;So,&nbsp;every&nbsp;time&nbsp;when&nbsp;you&nbsp;scroll&nbsp;through&nbsp;social&nbsp;media,&nbsp;watch&nbsp;something&nbsp;or&nbsp;shop&nbsp;online,&nbsp;you&nbsp;are&nbsp;unknowingly&nbsp;creating&nbsp;data.&nbsp;</p><p>Now,&nbsp;you&nbsp;might&nbsp;be&nbsp;wondering&nbsp;what&nbsp;kind&nbsp;of&nbsp;data.&nbsp;So,&nbsp;the&nbsp;data&nbsp;is&nbsp;what&nbsp;you&nbsp;like,&nbsp;what&nbsp;you&nbsp;click&nbsp;on,&nbsp;and&nbsp;how&nbsp;much&nbsp;time&nbsp;do&nbsp;you&nbsp;spend&nbsp;on&nbsp;something&nbsp;like&nbsp;any&nbsp;product&nbsp;or&nbsp;type&nbsp;of&nbsp;video&nbsp;content.&nbsp;All&nbsp;this&nbsp;is&nbsp;considered&nbsp;data.&nbsp;</p><p>But&nbsp;on&nbsp;its&nbsp;own,&nbsp;this&nbsp;raw&nbsp;data&nbsp;doesn’t&nbsp;really&nbsp;mean&nbsp;much.&nbsp;it’s&nbsp;just&nbsp;numbers&nbsp;and&nbsp;information.&nbsp;This&nbsp;is&nbsp;where&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;comes&nbsp;in.&nbsp;It&nbsp;takes&nbsp;all&nbsp;that&nbsp;raw&nbsp;data,&nbsp;organises&nbsp;it,&nbsp;and&nbsp;turns&nbsp;it&nbsp;into&nbsp;something&nbsp;useful&nbsp;that&nbsp;makes&nbsp;some&nbsp;sense—like&nbsp;understanding&nbsp;your&nbsp;preferences&nbsp;or&nbsp;predicting&nbsp;what&nbsp;you&nbsp;might&nbsp;want&nbsp;to&nbsp;see&nbsp;next.</p><p>It&nbsp;combines:</p><ul><li><strong>Statistics</strong>&nbsp;(to&nbsp;analyze&nbsp;patterns)</li><li><strong>Programming</strong>&nbsp;(to&nbsp;work&nbsp;with&nbsp;data&nbsp;using&nbsp;tools&nbsp;like&nbsp;Python)</li><li><strong>Domain&nbsp;knowledge</strong>&nbsp;(to&nbsp;understand&nbsp;real-world&nbsp;problems)</li></ul><p>So,&nbsp;yes,&nbsp;in&nbsp;short,&nbsp;we&nbsp;can&nbsp;say&nbsp;that&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science&nbsp;is&nbsp;the&nbsp;practice&nbsp;of&nbsp;analysing&nbsp;and&nbsp;interpreting&nbsp;data&nbsp;to&nbsp;extract&nbsp;insights&nbsp;and&nbsp;make&nbsp;informed&nbsp;decisions.&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>So,&nbsp;Is&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science&nbsp;Actually&nbsp;In&nbsp;Demand&nbsp;in&nbsp;India?</strong></h2><p>India&nbsp;is&nbsp;currently&nbsp;facing&nbsp;a&nbsp;serious&nbsp;shortage&nbsp;of&nbsp;skilled&nbsp;<a href="https://www.nidads.com/blog/data-science-roadmap" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">data&nbsp;science&nbsp;professionals&nbsp;roadmap.</a>&nbsp;As&nbsp;we&nbsp;are&nbsp;all&nbsp;aware&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;importance&nbsp;of&nbsp;data&nbsp;in&nbsp;today&#39;s&nbsp;time.&nbsp;Even&nbsp;companies&nbsp;are&nbsp;collecting&nbsp;more&nbsp;and&nbsp;more&nbsp;data&nbsp;than&nbsp;ever&nbsp;before.&nbsp;Hence,&nbsp;the&nbsp;requirement&nbsp;for&nbsp;those&nbsp;individuals&nbsp;who&nbsp;can&nbsp;make&nbsp;the&nbsp;best&nbsp;out&nbsp;of&nbsp;that&nbsp;data&nbsp;is&nbsp;increasing&nbsp;like&nbsp;crazy.&nbsp;And&nbsp;those&nbsp;individuals&nbsp;are&nbsp;data&nbsp;scientists.&nbsp;</p><p>Industry&nbsp;estimates&nbsp;show&nbsp;over&nbsp;1.5&nbsp;lakh&nbsp;unfilled&nbsp;data&nbsp;roles&nbsp;in&nbsp;India.&nbsp;The&nbsp;interesting&nbsp;fact&nbsp;about&nbsp;it&nbsp;is&nbsp;that&nbsp;the&nbsp;number&nbsp;is&nbsp;growing&nbsp;immensely&nbsp;in&nbsp;2026,&nbsp;but&nbsp;the&nbsp;number&nbsp;of&nbsp;people&nbsp;who&nbsp;can&nbsp;fill&nbsp;this&nbsp;gap&nbsp;is&nbsp;not&nbsp;increasing&nbsp;at&nbsp;that&nbsp;pace.&nbsp;Hence,&nbsp;this&nbsp;gap&nbsp;is&nbsp;your&nbsp;opportunity.&nbsp;And&nbsp;the&nbsp;amazing&nbsp;part&nbsp;is&nbsp;that&nbsp;government&nbsp;is&nbsp;joining&nbsp;the&nbsp;push&nbsp;and&nbsp;through&nbsp;National&nbsp;AI&nbsp;Mission.&nbsp;</p><p>What&nbsp;this&nbsp;means&nbsp;for&nbsp;you&nbsp;is&nbsp;simple:&nbsp;there&nbsp;are&nbsp;more&nbsp;jobs&nbsp;than&nbsp;there&nbsp;are&nbsp;good&nbsp;candidates&nbsp;right&nbsp;now.&nbsp;That&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;pretty&nbsp;rare&nbsp;situation&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;in.&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>What&nbsp;kind&nbsp;of&nbsp;roles&nbsp;can&nbsp;you&nbsp;actually&nbsp;get?</strong></h2><p>Data&nbsp;science&nbsp;is&nbsp;not&nbsp;limited&nbsp;to&nbsp;a&nbsp;single&nbsp;job;&nbsp;it&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;vast&nbsp;field,&nbsp;and&nbsp;you&nbsp;can&nbsp;choose&nbsp;one&nbsp;that&nbsp;best&nbsp;aligns&nbsp;with&nbsp;your&nbsp;skills.&nbsp;Beginners&nbsp;can&nbsp;start&nbsp;their&nbsp;journey&nbsp;with&nbsp;roles&nbsp;such&nbsp;as&nbsp;a&nbsp;data&nbsp;analyst&nbsp;or&nbsp;junior&nbsp;data&nbsp;scientist&nbsp;and&nbsp;improve&nbsp;their&nbsp;learning.&nbsp;Later,&nbsp;with&nbsp;experience,&nbsp;you&nbsp;can&nbsp;progress&nbsp;to&nbsp;advanced&nbsp;roles.&nbsp;Remember,&nbsp;a&nbsp;strong&nbsp;foundation,&nbsp;a&nbsp;clear&nbsp;portfolio,&nbsp;and&nbsp;hands-on&nbsp;experience.&nbsp;<a href="https://www.nidads.com/blog/statistics-for-data-science" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">statistics&nbsp;for&nbsp;data&nbsp;science</a></p><p><strong>Key&nbsp;points:</strong></p><ul><li>Data&nbsp;science&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;broad&nbsp;field&nbsp;with&nbsp;multiple&nbsp;career&nbsp;paths</li><li>Entry-level&nbsp;roles:&nbsp;data&nbsp;analyst,&nbsp;BI&nbsp;analyst,&nbsp;junior&nbsp;data&nbsp;scientist</li><li>Possible&nbsp;to&nbsp;start&nbsp;within&nbsp;6–12&nbsp;months&nbsp;of&nbsp;proper&nbsp;training</li><li>Open&nbsp;to&nbsp;non-technical&nbsp;backgrounds&nbsp;(commerce,&nbsp;arts,&nbsp;etc.)</li><li>Career&nbsp;growth:&nbsp;data&nbsp;scientist&nbsp;→&nbsp;ML&nbsp;engineer&nbsp;→&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;manager</li><li>Senior&nbsp;roles&nbsp;(e.g.,&nbsp;leadership)&nbsp;come&nbsp;with&nbsp;experience</li><li>No&nbsp;need&nbsp;for&nbsp;years&nbsp;of&nbsp;experience&nbsp;to&nbsp;get&nbsp;started</li><li>Projects&nbsp;+&nbsp;portfolio&nbsp;matter&nbsp;more&nbsp;than&nbsp;just&nbsp;theory&nbsp;</li></ul><h2><strong>What&nbsp;does&nbsp;the&nbsp;salary&nbsp;look&nbsp;like?</strong></h2><p>Here&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;realistic&nbsp;picture&nbsp;for&nbsp;India&nbsp;in&nbsp;2026:&nbsp;</p><p class="ql-align-center"><strong>Role</strong></p><p class="ql-align-center"><strong>Fresher&nbsp;(0–1&nbsp;yr)</strong></p><p class="ql-align-center"><strong>Mid-level&nbsp;(3–5&nbsp;yr)</strong></p><p>Data&nbsp;Analyst</p><p>₹3.5&nbsp;–&nbsp;6&nbsp;LPA</p><p>₹8&nbsp;–&nbsp;14&nbsp;LPA</p><p>Data&nbsp;Scientist</p><p>₹6&nbsp;–&nbsp;10&nbsp;LPA</p><p>₹14&nbsp;–&nbsp;25&nbsp;LPA</p><p>ML&nbsp;Engineer</p><p>₹7&nbsp;–&nbsp;12&nbsp;LPA</p><p>₹18&nbsp;–&nbsp;30&nbsp;LPA</p><p>BI&nbsp;Analyst</p><p>₹4&nbsp;–&nbsp;7&nbsp;LPA</p><p>₹10&nbsp;–&nbsp;18&nbsp;LPA</p><p>Cities&nbsp;like&nbsp;Bengaluru,&nbsp;Hyderabad,&nbsp;and&nbsp;Delhi&nbsp;NCR&nbsp;offer&nbsp;the&nbsp;highest&nbsp;packages.&nbsp;Delhi&nbsp;NCR,&nbsp;in&nbsp;particular,&nbsp;has&nbsp;seen&nbsp;a&nbsp;sharp&nbsp;jump&nbsp;in&nbsp;data&nbsp;hiring&nbsp;over&nbsp;the&nbsp;last&nbsp;two&nbsp;years,&nbsp;which&nbsp;makes&nbsp;it&nbsp;one&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;better&nbsp;regions&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;job-hunting&nbsp;in&nbsp;if&nbsp;you&nbsp;are&nbsp;based&nbsp;in&nbsp;North&nbsp;India.&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>What&nbsp;about&nbsp;AI&nbsp;—&nbsp;will&nbsp;it&nbsp;kill&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;jobs?</strong></h2><p>Many&nbsp;people&nbsp;think&nbsp;that&nbsp;AI&nbsp;will&nbsp;take&nbsp;their&nbsp;jobs,&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;same&nbsp;thinking&nbsp;applies&nbsp;to&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;jobs.&nbsp;But&nbsp;let&nbsp;me&nbsp;clear&nbsp;you&nbsp;the&nbsp;picture&nbsp;and&nbsp;that&nbsp;is&nbsp;AI&nbsp;is&nbsp;changing&nbsp;job&nbsp;scenario&nbsp;only&nbsp;by&nbsp;replacing&nbsp;it&nbsp;with&nbsp;basic&nbsp;code,&nbsp;generating&nbsp;quick&nbsp;chats,&nbsp;drafting&nbsp;initial&nbsp;reports.&nbsp;However,&nbsp;the&nbsp;companies&nbsp;still&nbsp;need&nbsp;someone&nbsp;who&nbsp;understands&nbsp;the&nbsp;business&nbsp;problem&nbsp;behind&nbsp;the&nbsp;data.&nbsp;<a href="https://www.bls.gov/ooh/math/data-scientists.htm?utm_source=chatgpt.com" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">data&nbsp;scientist&nbsp;career&nbsp;outlook</a></p><p>The&nbsp;answer&nbsp;is&nbsp;simple:&nbsp;only&nbsp;repetitive&nbsp;or&nbsp;basic&nbsp;tasks&nbsp;are&nbsp;being&nbsp;replaced&nbsp;by&nbsp;AI,&nbsp;but&nbsp;skilled&nbsp;people&nbsp;with&nbsp;data-driven&nbsp;strategies&nbsp;remain&nbsp;in&nbsp;high&nbsp;demand&nbsp;and&nbsp;secure&nbsp;future&nbsp;job&nbsp;security.&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Okay,&nbsp;So&nbsp;How&nbsp;Do&nbsp;You&nbsp;Actually&nbsp;Get&nbsp;Started?</strong></h2><p>This&nbsp;is&nbsp;where&nbsp;a&nbsp;lot&nbsp;of&nbsp;people&nbsp;get&nbsp;stuck.&nbsp;They&nbsp;know&nbsp;that&nbsp;they&nbsp;want&nbsp;to&nbsp;get&nbsp;into&nbsp;data&nbsp;science,&nbsp;but&nbsp;they&nbsp;are&nbsp;not&nbsp;sure&nbsp;whether&nbsp;to&nbsp;do&nbsp;a&nbsp;random&nbsp;online&nbsp;course,&nbsp;a&nbsp;degree,&nbsp;or&nbsp;something&nbsp;structured.</p><p>Here,&nbsp;many&nbsp;students&nbsp;make&nbsp;mistakes.&nbsp;They&nbsp;solely&nbsp;rely&nbsp;on&nbsp;YouTube&nbsp;tutorials&nbsp;instead&nbsp;of&nbsp;searching&nbsp;for&nbsp;a&nbsp;structured&nbsp;program.&nbsp;The&nbsp;skill&nbsp;difference&nbsp;is&nbsp;huge&nbsp;between&nbsp;the&nbsp;student&nbsp;who&nbsp;learn&nbsp;from&nbsp;a&nbsp;structured&nbsp;program&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;one&nbsp;who&nbsp;learn&nbsp;from&nbsp;YouTube&nbsp;videos.&nbsp;</p><p>Recruiters&nbsp;always&nbsp;look&nbsp;for&nbsp;individuals&nbsp;who&nbsp;have&nbsp;hands-on&nbsp;experience&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;skills&nbsp;which&nbsp;they&nbsp;mentioned&nbsp;in&nbsp;their&nbsp;resume,&nbsp;even&nbsp;if&nbsp;you&nbsp;are&nbsp;a&nbsp;fresher.&nbsp;They&nbsp;can&nbsp;easily&nbsp;identify&nbsp;whether&nbsp;a&nbsp;person&nbsp;coming&nbsp;for&nbsp;an&nbsp;interview&nbsp;has&nbsp;done&nbsp;any&nbsp;proper&nbsp;training&nbsp;or&nbsp;just&nbsp;came&nbsp;with&nbsp;tutorial&nbsp;knowledge.&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>NIDADS&nbsp;–&nbsp;Turn&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Skills&nbsp;into&nbsp;Career&nbsp;Opportunities&nbsp;</strong></h2><p>At&nbsp;NIDADS&nbsp;—&nbsp;National&nbsp;Institute&nbsp;of&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics&nbsp;and&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science&nbsp;—&nbsp;the&nbsp;entire&nbsp;programme&nbsp;is&nbsp;built&nbsp;around&nbsp;this.&nbsp;You&nbsp;do&nbsp;not&nbsp;just&nbsp;learn&nbsp;Python&nbsp;or&nbsp;SQL&nbsp;in&nbsp;theory.&nbsp;You&nbsp;work&nbsp;on&nbsp;live&nbsp;industry&nbsp;projects&nbsp;from&nbsp;day&nbsp;one,&nbsp;so&nbsp;that&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;time&nbsp;you&nbsp;are&nbsp;sitting&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;job&nbsp;interview,&nbsp;you&nbsp;are&nbsp;not&nbsp;showing&nbsp;a&nbsp;certificate&nbsp;—&nbsp;you&nbsp;are&nbsp;showing&nbsp;actual&nbsp;work.</p><p>The&nbsp;placement&nbsp;support&nbsp;at&nbsp;NIDADS&nbsp;goes&nbsp;beyond&nbsp;just&nbsp;connecting&nbsp;you&nbsp;to&nbsp;companies.&nbsp;You&nbsp;get&nbsp;resume&nbsp;prep,&nbsp;mock&nbsp;interviews,&nbsp;and&nbsp;direct&nbsp;referrals&nbsp;to&nbsp;hiring&nbsp;partners&nbsp;—&nbsp;which&nbsp;matters&nbsp;a&nbsp;lot&nbsp;when&nbsp;you&nbsp;are&nbsp;a&nbsp;fresher&nbsp;competing&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;market&nbsp;where&nbsp;everyone&nbsp;has&nbsp;the&nbsp;same&nbsp;degree.</p><p>Whether&nbsp;you&nbsp;just&nbsp;finished&nbsp;12th&nbsp;or&nbsp;you&nbsp;are&nbsp;a&nbsp;graduate&nbsp;looking&nbsp;to&nbsp;change&nbsp;direction,&nbsp;there&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;programme&nbsp;built&nbsp;for&nbsp;where&nbsp;you&nbsp;are&nbsp;right&nbsp;now.</p><p><strong><u><a href="https://www.nidads.com/course" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">See&nbsp;all&nbsp;courses&nbsp;at&nbsp;NIDADS&nbsp;</a></u></strong></p><h2><strong>FAQs</strong></h2><p><strong>Q:&nbsp;Is&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;still&nbsp;in&nbsp;demand&nbsp;in&nbsp;India&nbsp;in&nbsp;2026?</strong></p><p>A:&nbsp;Yes,&nbsp;the&nbsp;field&nbsp;of&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;is&nbsp;booming&nbsp;like&nbsp;crazy.&nbsp;The&nbsp;current&nbsp;demand&nbsp;has&nbsp;over&nbsp;1.5&nbsp;lakh&nbsp;unfilled&nbsp;roles&nbsp;across&nbsp;sectors&nbsp;like&nbsp;banking,&nbsp;healthcare,&nbsp;retail,&nbsp;and&nbsp;government.&nbsp;</p><p></p><p><strong>Q:&nbsp;Can&nbsp;a&nbsp;commerce&nbsp;or&nbsp;arts&nbsp;student&nbsp;pursue&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;in&nbsp;India?</strong></p><p>A:&nbsp;Yes,&nbsp;you&nbsp;can.&nbsp;Regardless&nbsp;of&nbsp;your&nbsp;stream,&nbsp;you&nbsp;can&nbsp;pursue&nbsp;the&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;course&nbsp;in&nbsp;India&nbsp;after&nbsp;12th.&nbsp;Many&nbsp;working&nbsp;data&nbsp;analysts&nbsp;and&nbsp;data&nbsp;scientists&nbsp;come&nbsp;from&nbsp;commerce&nbsp;and&nbsp;arts&nbsp;backgrounds.&nbsp;</p><p></p><p><strong>Q:&nbsp;What&nbsp;is&nbsp;the&nbsp;starting&nbsp;salary&nbsp;for&nbsp;a&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;fresher&nbsp;in&nbsp;India?</strong></p><p>A:&nbsp;It&nbsp;depends&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;skill&nbsp;set&nbsp;you&nbsp;possess,&nbsp;but&nbsp;the&nbsp;average&nbsp;range&nbsp;is&nbsp;between&nbsp;₹6&nbsp;and&nbsp;₹10&nbsp;LPA.&nbsp;The&nbsp;salaries&nbsp;also&nbsp;vary&nbsp;by&nbsp;city.&nbsp;If&nbsp;you&nbsp;are&nbsp;looking&nbsp;for&nbsp;a&nbsp;job&nbsp;in&nbsp;metropolitan&nbsp;cities&nbsp;like&nbsp;Delhi&nbsp;NCR,&nbsp;Bangalore,&nbsp;and&nbsp;Hyderabad,&nbsp;the&nbsp;payout&nbsp;is&nbsp;quite&nbsp;high.&nbsp;</p><p></p><p><strong>Q:&nbsp;Will&nbsp;AI&nbsp;replace&nbsp;data&nbsp;scientists&nbsp;in&nbsp;India?</strong></p><p>A:&nbsp;Well,&nbsp;you&nbsp;have&nbsp;to&nbsp;understand&nbsp;that&nbsp;the&nbsp;AI&nbsp;is&nbsp;only&nbsp;capturing&nbsp;those&nbsp;jobs&nbsp;or&nbsp;the&nbsp;part&nbsp;of&nbsp;jobs&nbsp;that&nbsp;are&nbsp;basic&nbsp;or&nbsp;repetitive,&nbsp;such&nbsp;as&nbsp;basic&nbsp;code&nbsp;generation.&nbsp;However,&nbsp;companies&nbsp;still&nbsp;need&nbsp;those&nbsp;people&nbsp;who&nbsp;can&nbsp;make&nbsp;data-driven&nbsp;strategies&nbsp;and&nbsp;have&nbsp;excellent&nbsp;knowledge&nbsp;of&nbsp;AI&nbsp;tools,&nbsp;along&nbsp;with&nbsp;solving&nbsp;business&nbsp;problems,&nbsp;and&nbsp;applying&nbsp;real&nbsp;judgment.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Q:&nbsp;How&nbsp;long&nbsp;does&nbsp;it&nbsp;take&nbsp;to&nbsp;get&nbsp;a&nbsp;job&nbsp;in&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;after&nbsp;a&nbsp;course?</strong></p><p>A:&nbsp;With&nbsp;a&nbsp;structured&nbsp;programme&nbsp;that&nbsp;includes&nbsp;hands-on&nbsp;project&nbsp;work&nbsp;and&nbsp;placement&nbsp;support,&nbsp;most&nbsp;students&nbsp;land&nbsp;their&nbsp;first&nbsp;role&nbsp;within&nbsp;3&nbsp;to&nbsp;6&nbsp;months&nbsp;of&nbsp;completing&nbsp;the&nbsp;course.&nbsp;A&nbsp;strong&nbsp;portfolio&nbsp;of&nbsp;real&nbsp;projects&nbsp;matters&nbsp;more&nbsp;to&nbsp;recruiters&nbsp;than&nbsp;just&nbsp;a&nbsp;certificate.</p><p></p><p><strong>Q:&nbsp;Which&nbsp;industries&nbsp;in&nbsp;India&nbsp;hire&nbsp;the&nbsp;most&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;professionals?</strong></p><p>A:&nbsp;When&nbsp;it&nbsp;comes&nbsp;to&nbsp;industries&nbsp;that&nbsp;do&nbsp;the&nbsp;most&nbsp;hiring&nbsp;of&nbsp;data&nbsp;scientists,&nbsp;they&nbsp;are&nbsp;banking&nbsp;and&nbsp;fintech.&nbsp;And&nbsp;following&nbsp;that,&nbsp;e-commerce,&nbsp;IT,&nbsp;and&nbsp;healthcare&nbsp;also&nbsp;provide&nbsp;massive&nbsp;hiring&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;same&nbsp;job&nbsp;profile.&nbsp;The&nbsp;scope&nbsp;is&nbsp;wide&nbsp;enough&nbsp;that&nbsp;you&nbsp;are&nbsp;not&nbsp;locked&nbsp;into&nbsp;a&nbsp;single&nbsp;industry.&nbsp;</p><h2>Conclusion</h2><p>A&nbsp;<a href="https://www.ibm.com/think/topics/data-science?utm_source=chatgpt.com" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">data&nbsp;science&nbsp;career</a>&nbsp;in&nbsp;India&nbsp;can&nbsp;be&nbsp;a&nbsp;strong&nbsp;choice&nbsp;in&nbsp;2026&nbsp;for&nbsp;students,&nbsp;graduates,&nbsp;and&nbsp;professionals&nbsp;ready&nbsp;to&nbsp;build&nbsp;practical&nbsp;skills.&nbsp;Growing&nbsp;demand,&nbsp;diverse&nbsp;career&nbsp;paths,&nbsp;competitive&nbsp;salaries,&nbsp;and&nbsp;AI-driven&nbsp;opportunities&nbsp;make&nbsp;the&nbsp;field&nbsp;promising.&nbsp;However,&nbsp;success&nbsp;depends&nbsp;on&nbsp;more&nbsp;than&nbsp;a&nbsp;certificate.&nbsp;Learn&nbsp;Python,&nbsp;SQL,&nbsp;statistics,&nbsp;machine&nbsp;learning,&nbsp;and&nbsp;data&nbsp;visualization,&nbsp;build&nbsp;real-world&nbsp;projects,&nbsp;and&nbsp;develop&nbsp;a&nbsp;strong&nbsp;portfolio&nbsp;to&nbsp;become&nbsp;job-ready&nbsp;and&nbsp;grow&nbsp;confidently&nbsp;in&nbsp;India’s&nbsp;data-driven&nbsp;economy.</p><h2><strong>About&nbsp;the&nbsp;Author</strong></h2><p>Quick&nbsp;facts</p><p><strong>Name:</strong>&nbsp;Shagun</p><p><strong>From:</strong>&nbsp;Delhi</p><p><strong>Education:</strong>&nbsp;B.Tech</p><p><strong>Program:</strong>&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science&nbsp;and&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics</p><p><strong>Placed&nbsp;in:</strong>&nbsp;NIDADS&nbsp;(National&nbsp;Institute&nbsp;of&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science)</p><p><strong>Covers&nbsp;topics:</strong>&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science,&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics,&nbsp;Artificial&nbsp;Intelligence,&nbsp;Machine&nbsp;Learning,&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Engineering,&nbsp;Deep&nbsp;Learning</p><p><strong>Currently&nbsp;working&nbsp;as:&nbsp;</strong>Senior&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science&nbsp;Trainer</p><p><strong>In&nbsp;her&nbsp;words</strong>:&nbsp;&quot;The&nbsp;best&nbsp;way&nbsp;to&nbsp;learn&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;isn&#39;t&nbsp;just&nbsp;solving&nbsp;problems&nbsp;—&nbsp;it&#39;s&nbsp;understanding&nbsp;why&nbsp;the&nbsp;solution&nbsp;works.&nbsp;That&#39;s&nbsp;what&nbsp;I&nbsp;try&nbsp;to&nbsp;teach&nbsp;every&nbsp;single&nbsp;day.&quot;</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  
</body>
</html>